{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#rem:dc-ch2-2-3","title":"rem:dc-ch2-2-3","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections.md","line":78,"body":"","kind":"other","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections.tex#rem:dc-ch2-2-3","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#rem:dc-ch0-5-7]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#def:dc-ch2-2-1]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections.tex","label":"rem:dc-ch2-2-3","line":168,"source":"\\begin{remark}[Remark 2.3]\n  \\label{rem:dc-ch2-2-3}\n\n  \\uses{rem:dc-ch0-5-7, def:dc-ch2-2-1}\n\n  \\dcref{ch2:2.3}\n  An affine connection is local. In coordinates, if\n  $X=\\sum_ix_iX_i$, $Y=\\sum_jy_jX_j$, and\n  $\\nabla_{X_i}X_j=\\sum_k\\Gamma_{ij}^kX_k$, then\n  \\[\n    \\nabla_XY\n      =\\sum_{i,j}x_iy_j\\nabla_{X_i}X_j+\\sum_jX(y_j)X_j\n      =\\sum_k\\left(\\sum_{i,j}x_iy_j\\Gamma_{ij}^k+X(y_k)\\right)X_k.\n  \\]\n  Hence $\\nabla_XY(p)$ depends only on $X(p)$ and the germ of $Y$ at $p$.\n\\end{remark}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Remark</div></section>[Remark 2.3] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-72656d3a64632d6368322d322d33\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23rem%3Adc-ch0-5-7\">↗ rem:dc-ch0-5-7</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections%23def%3Adc-ch2-2-1\">↗ def:dc-ch2-2-1</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.3</span></span>An affine connection is local. In coordinates, if <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X=\\sum _ix_iX_i$\">$X=\\sum _ix_iX_i$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Y=\\sum _jy_jX_j$\">$Y=\\sum _jy_jX_j$</span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\nabla _{X_i}X_j=\\sum _k\\Gamma _{ij}^kX_k$\">$\\nabla _{X_i}X_j=\\sum _k\\Gamma _{ij}^kX_k$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\nabla _XY =\\sum _{i,j}x_iy_j\\nabla _{X_i}X_j+\\sum _jX(y_j)X_j =\\sum _k\\left(\\sum _{i,j}x_iy_j\\Gamma _{ij}^k+X(y_k)\\right)X_k.  \\]\">\\[  \\nabla _XY =\\sum _{i,j}x_iy_j\\nabla _{X_i}X_j+\\sum _jX(y_j)X_j =\\sum _k\\left(\\sum _{i,j}x_iy_j\\Gamma _{ij}^k+X(y_k)\\right)X_k.  \\]</span> Hence <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\nabla _XY(p)$\">$\\nabla _XY(p)$</span> depends only on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X(p)$\">$X(p)$</span> and the germ of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Y$\">$Y$</span> at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#lem:dc-ch2-2-2-c-bridge","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#rem:dc-ch2-2-4","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#rem:dc-ch0-5-7","title":"rem:dc-ch0-5-7","label":"rem:dc-ch0-5-7"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_AffineConnectionsRiemannianConnections#def:dc-ch2-2-1","title":"def:dc-ch2-2-1","label":"def:dc-ch2-2-1"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch04_Curvature#rem:dc-ch4-2-6","title":"rem:dc-ch4-2-6","label":"rem:dc-ch4-2-6"}],"copy_context":